		{
			"identifier": "SlideZone",
			"uid": 65,
			"tags": [],
			"exportToToc": false,
			"allowOutOfBounds": false,
			"doc": "Floor that will not hold him. Inside it his steering drops to control_strength, a drag builds along `angle`, and jump and dash are gone. Full control returns on exit. Stretch it over the floor it applies to; nothing is drawn in game, so give the room a surface that looks slick.",
